    "# 3. Model\n",
    "\n",
    "The crop and disease cosine heads share a learned projection over frozen DINOv2. AM-Softmax trains the same heads used at inference. Build the prototype bank from projected fit images using the deterministic evaluation transform. The prototype branch uses a crop-conditional disease centroid when present and a global disease centroid otherwise. Hybrid scores blend the sum of concept log-probabilities with the sum of crop and disease prototype cosine similarities."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "hybrid-model",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
