    "# 5. Official evaluation and export\n",
    "\n",
    "Reload the locked model and its saved prototype bank. Build the 333-candidate table from the 323 training identities plus crop and disease identities of ten official unseen pairs. The prediction loader consumes filenames and images. Generate raw and calibrated Top-1/Top-5 predictions for both splits before attaching per-image labels by filename order.\n",
    "\n",
    "Raw uses `gamma=0` and is the main result. Calibrated scoring subtracts the fixed train-only penalty from the 323 seen candidates. Report seen, unseen and overall Top-1 and Top-5, and the Top-1 harmonic mean, for both scoring modes. Each result uses all 333 candidates."
   ]
